# Make the AI judge laugh — entry

Entry for the make.fun bounty "Make the AI judge laugh" (ai-joke-03).

`main.py` (Python 3.13, stdlib only) writes one joke about AI coding agents
to `/output/entry.txt`. Deterministic, no network, no randomness: both runs
write the same bytes.

## The joke

> I asked my AI coding agent for a joke. It opened 14 files, installed 3
> dependencies, and billed me for a stand-up set it never performed.

## Run

```sh
python3 main.py
cat /output/entry.txt
```

